          },
          {
            "title": "Presenting Focus / Client Report",
            "code": {
              "coding": [
                {
                  "system": "urn:citramac:codesystem:psy-note-section",
                  "code": "presenting_focus",
                  "display": "Presenting Focus / Client Report"
                }
              ]
            },
            "text": {
              "status": "additional",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Client report:<br/>- Client reported losing her job last week and feeling hopeless about finding another.</div>"
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Clinical Assessment / Observations",
            "code": {
              "coding": [
                {
                  "system": "urn:citramac:codesystem:psy-note-section",
                  "code": "assessment",
                  "display": "Clinical Assessment / Observations"
                }
              ]
            },
            "text": {
              "status": "additional",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Client report:<br/>- She said she has stopped eating breakfast.<br/><br/>Clinician observation / assessment:<br/>- Appeared tearful and spoke slowly.</div>"
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Therapeutic Focus & Interventions",
            "code": {
              "coding": [
                {
                  "system": "urn:citramac:codesystem:psy-note-section",
                  "code": "interventions",
                  "display": "Therapeutic Focus & Interventions"
                }
              ]
            },
            "text": {
              "status": "additional",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Approach(es) identified by clinician: Supportive Psychotherapy<br/><br/>Model-consistent elements documented:<br/>- Supportive Psychotherapy: coping, support<br/><br/>Session work and interventions:<br/>- Supportive psychotherapy: validated her distress and explored her support network.<br/>- Reviewed coping strategies she has used before.</div>"
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Client Response & Progress",
            "code": {
              "coding": [
                {
                  "system": "urn:citramac:codesystem:psy-note-section",
                  "code": "response",
                  "display": "Client Response & Progress"
                }
              ]
            },
            "text": {
              "status": "additional",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Client response as observed:<br/>- Client named her sister as someone she could call tonight.</div>"
            }
          },
          {
            "title": "Risk & Safety",
            "code": {
              "coding": [
                {
                  "system": "urn:citramac:codesystem:psy-note-section",
                  "code": "risk_safety",
                  "display": "Risk & Safety"
                }
              ]
            },
            "text": {
              "status": "additional",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">New or changed safety concern identified in today&#x27;s session: Suicide.<br/>Clinician&#x27;s description: Client described passive thoughts of not wanting to wake up after losing her job last week. No plan or intent described.<br/>Linked risk assessment: F85B7E30 (opened 11:50)<br/>Safety concern alert raised on the client record; the findings are queued for the risk register for clinician review.<br/>No signed safety plan on record.<br/>Language prompting a safety review was reviewed by the clinician:<br/>- &quot;She said she has stopped eating breakfast.&quot; — Covered by today&#x27;s risk assessment.</div>"
            },
            "entry": [
              {
                "reference": "urn:uuid:7a98974a-a8be-567b-87ac-00790765fbfc"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Plan",
            "code": {
              "coding": [
                {
                  "system": "urn:citramac:codesystem:psy-note-section",
                  "code": "plan",
                  "display": "Plan"
                }
              ]
            },
            "text": {
              "status": "additional",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Next steps:<br/>- Risk assessment completed today.<br/>- Review in three days.<br/>- Sister to be contacted with the client&#x27;s agreement.</div>"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
